/* `with_semi` is accepted for signature parity with the type writer. */
/* Write one ADT layout: the tag, the union with one member per payload-bearing
   variant, the four ABI assertions and (for an owning ADT) the retain/release
   protocol. `n` is the declaration node when a `typedef`/attribute applies;
